%p
  Hi
  = @work_order.client_display_name.presence || "there"
  ,

%p
  Please find attached your estimate for
  %strong= @work_order.title
  (#{@work_order.number}).

%table{ style: "width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;" }
  %thead
    %tr
      %th{ style: "text-align:left;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dee2e6;" } Description
      %th{ style: "text-align:right;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dee2e6;" } Amount
  %tbody
    - @work_order.work_order_items.each do |item|
      %tr
        %td{ style: "padding:6px 0;" } #{item.quantity} × #{item.name}
        %td{ style: "text-align:right;padding:6px 0;" }= humanized_money_with_symbol(item.line_total)
  %tfoot
    %tr
      %td{ style: "padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid #dee2e6;" }
        %strong Total
      %td{ style: "text-align:right;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid #dee2e6;" }
        %strong= humanized_money_with_symbol(@work_order.total)

%p{ style: "margin-top:24px;color:#6c757d;" }
  The PDF estimate is attached. Please review it and we'll follow up with a link to sign the contract digitally.

%p{ style: "margin-top:16px;" }
  If you have any questions, please reply to this email.
